  <h2>§0 Observation round</h2>
  <h3>0.1 Blind observation</h3>
  <p>Genesis 1 creates by speaking: “and God said… and it was”; bara is used only for God’s creating. Light comes on day 1 (1:3), the lights (sun/moon/stars) only on day 4 (1:14-18), set “for signs and for seasons” (moadim). Seven times “it was good”; man in God’s image (1:27). Then Genesis 3: “she took… and ate” (grasping, wanting to be as God); the relationship 